<title>USA: Block Financial president resigns.</title>
<headline>Block Financial president resigns.</headline>
<dateline>KANSAS CITY, Mo. 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>H&amp;R Block Inc said Tuesday that William Anderson, president of Block Financial Corp, resigned to become president of Bank Rate Monitor, a Florida-based publisher of financial information.</p>
<p>Block Financial, an H&amp;R Block subsidiary, provides financial services, manages commercial loans and a second mortgage business.  </p>
<p>Anderson's staff will report to Frank Salizzoni, H&amp;R Block's president and chief executive officer, until Anderson's replacement is named.</p>
<p>H&amp;R Block shares closed off 1/2 at 32-1/2.</p>
<p>		 ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
